@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — evidence and dependent commitments
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Accepted scope / constraints / profile core\nExisting authoritative ASM / DEP / RSK / GAP records" as Sources
rectangle "Known bounded input\n20 h/week; observed demo; OAuth/backup absence\nPopulated logical models / scenarios" as Known
rectangle "Affected design question + actual evidence needed\nNo source association or tool demo implies feasibility" as Question
rectangle "Scoped dependent commitment\nActual identified candidate / conditions / owner disposition" as Commit #DFF1EA
Sources --> Known
Known --> Question
Question --> Commit : only supported evaluated scope
note bottom of Question
Independent modeling and unselected design proposals may continue.
Missing decisive evidence limits the dependent acceptance.
No overall feasibility finding is manufactured.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
